;
; MapEditorDialog (plan 19 §3.10): the editor shell. Static toolbar/team/brush/
; show-toggle/palette structure is declared here (tscn-first, editor-navigable);
; map_editor_dialog.gd wires it to /root/Spine/MindEditor. Block rows and team
; buttons are data-driven and built in code.
;
; Ported from Mindustry (https://github.com/Anuken/Mindustry) — GPL-3.0.
; Source: core/src/mindustry/editor/MapEditorDialog.java

[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

